{
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-0r.char": "您好，涅奥先生！介意我问您几个问题吗？",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-1r.ancient": "有问……必答……你要的答案……在高塔之顶……",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-0r.char": "我一直很好奇，您究竟为什么一直守护着爬塔的冒险家呢？",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-1r.ancient": "前进吧……找到……你的答案……",

  "DARV.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-0r.char": "您好，先生！我想采访一下，您在高塔收集奇珍异宝，是为了什么呢？",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-1r.ancient": "咱的宝贝只给有缘分的旅客！小姑娘，我看你就不错，过来拿点东西再走吧！",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-0r.char": "先生，请问您在尖塔里居住了多久了？这里的生态环境一直以来有什么变化吗？",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-1r.ancient": "我只知道咱能捡到的财宝是越来越多了！",

  "PAEL.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-0r.char": "来——笑一个！茄子！",
