  "PAEL.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-1r.ancient": "茄子……",
  "PAEL.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-0r.char": "这里可真是奇妙，泥做的龙居然会说话。",
