  "PAEL.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-1r.ancient": "泥做的龙……还能……给予你祝福……",

  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-0r.ancient": "粉色的人类！从塔外来！带着亮闪闪？",
