  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-1r.char": "这个是留影机啦！来——看镜头，不要眨眼哦！",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-2r.ancient": "好多字！人类！新闻？",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-0r.ancient": "故事！有没有带来？快讲讲！讲讲！",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.1-1r.char": "我这里有一份蒸汽鸟报，你要看吗？",

