  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-1r.char": "谢谢您，老婆婆！方便我问您几个问题吗？",

  "NONUPEIPE.talk.STS2_CHARLOTTE_CHARACTER_CHARLOTTE.0-0r.ancient": "真是漂亮又得体的打扮，我从未在尖塔中见过你这样充满活力的姑娘。",
